Session 1 — T001–T010: Core game loop, resource management, building system, basic UI.
Built tick engine (4 ticks/s), resource rates, gold/food/wood/stone/iron/mana caps, building purchase queue, HUD display, message log.

Session 2 — T011–T020: Map system, fog of war, combat, territory expansion.
Added 20×20 tile map, fog reveal on conquest, attack preview, tile defense bonuses, loot collection.

Session 3 — T021–T030: Technology tree, age progression, unit training.
Research queue, 4 age tiers (Stone/Bronze/Iron/Medieval), unit unlock gates, training time display.

Session 4 — T031–T040: Diplomacy, AI empires, trade routes.
Three AI factions (Iron Horde, Mage Council, Sea Wolves), relations (neutral/war/allied), trade route income, war declarations.

Session 5 — T041–T050: Hero system, spells, prestige.
Recruit hero, three abilities (Battle Cry/Inspire/Siege), spell cooldowns, prestige score tracking.

Session 6 — T051–T060: Random events, quests, story log.
Pub/sub event bus, 10 random event types with modifiers, 8 quests with rewards, empire story timeline.

Session 7 — T061–T070: Seasons, morale, garrison, hero leveling.
Four seasons affecting resource rates, morale system (0-100), garrison units for defense, hero XP and skill choices.

Session 8 — T071–T080: Synergies, political events, mercenaries, weather.
Tech synergy pairs, council boons at age transitions, mercenary hire offers, weather events with rate penalties.

Session 9 — T081–T090: Barbarian sieges, prestige panel, decrees, contracts.
Barbarian siege warnings with countdown, prestige leaderboard display, imperial decrees with cooldowns, delivery contracts.

Session 10 — T091–T100: Hero expeditions, wandering merchant, border skirmishes, landmarks.
Hero training expeditions, wandering merchant with 3 items, AI vs AI skirmishes, capturable landmark tiles.

Session 11 — T101–T110: Building specialization, seasonal events, faction capitals, citizen roles.
Building upgrade paths, mid-season special events, faction capital capture bonuses, citizen role assignments.

Session 12 — T111–T120: Capital development plans, conquest streaks, military aid, festivals.
Capital plan selection at age-up, streak multipliers, allied military aid requests, festival declarations.

Session 13 — T121–T130: Resource nodes, empire titles, ruin excavation, unit upgrades.
Spawning resource node deposits, title progression system, ancient ruin digs, unit arsenal upgrades.

Session 14 — T131–T140: Exploration milestones, warlord duels, pioneer expeditions, natural disasters.
