Session 67 — T317–T318: Wandering Leatherworker, Royal Apothecary.
Leatherworker: Bronze Age+, 8+ tiles, 12-17 min spawn, 80s window. Commission Imperial Saddles (25 food + 15g → +0.2 food/s 2.5min · +18 prestige · +10 morale), Trade for Leather Goods (20 food → +0.15 gold/s 2min · +12 prestige). Warm brown/amber pulse CSS. Apothecary: Medieval Age+, 10+ tiles, 14-19 min spawn, 80s window. Commission Imperial Remedies (30 mana + 15g → +0.25 mana/s 2.5min · +22 prestige · +12 morale), Purchase Exotic Potions (25 food → +0.2 food/s 2min · +15 prestige · +8 morale). Teal/mint pulse CSS. Both fully wired into main.js (import, registerSystem, init x2, save/load) and questPanel.js (import, section render, handlers, ENCOUNTER_EVENTS). Events added to events.js.

Session 56 — T301–T302: Wandering Sculptor, Royal Vintner.
